1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,944
这是一个奶酪聊天机器人，跑在你的笔记本上
Here is a cheese chatbot, running on your laptop.

2
00:00:03,264 --> 00:00:05,461
你问它 Tolminc 奶酪是怎么做的
You ask it how Tolminc cheese is made.

3
00:00:05,781 --> 00:00:09,536
答案出来了，附带 10 段书里的原文作为参考来源
An answer appears, with ten book passages as references.

4
00:00:09,783 --> 00:00:13,004
在这一个回答背后，你的浏览器发起了三次调用
Behind that one answer, your browser makes three calls.

5
00:00:13,324 --> 00:00:16,505
其中两次打到 port 9000 上的一个 Python 服务器
Two go to a Python server on port 9000,

6
00:00:16,505 --> 00:00:19,767
一次打到 port 8000 上的一个数据库
and one goes to a database on port 8000.

7
00:00:20,087 --> 00:00:23,458
这两个服务器调用的背后，都是 Google 在干重活
Behind both server calls, Google does the heavy lifting.

8
00:00:23,778 --> 00:00:25,655
那么，谁来确认真的是你？
So who checks that it is really you?

9
00:00:25,975 --> 00:00:29,794
还有，网页怎么找到 container 里的数据库？
And how does a web page find a database inside a container?

10
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:32,038
这个应用里藏着三个小谜题
Three small riddles hide in this app.

11
00:00:32,358 --> 00:00:37,862
参数 -p 3200:3000 里有两个数字，为什么？
The flag -p 3200:3000 has two numbers; why?

12
00:00:38,182 --> 00:00:41,446
还有这里的 localhost:9000，指的是哪台机器？
And localhost:9000: which machine is that?

13
00:00:41,766 --> 00:00:45,692
而 llm-rag-chromadb 只是一个名字，它的地址在哪儿？
And llm-rag-chromadb is only a name; where is its address?

14
00:00:46,012 --> 00:00:47,910
每个谜题今天都会揭晓答案
Each one gets its answer today.

15
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:52,817
然后真正的问题来了：既然谁都能来敲门，谁才能进来？
Then the real question arrives: once anything can knock, who is allowed in?

16
00:00:53,067 --> 00:00:57,591
跟着做需要你 clone 的 cheese-app-v0、Docker Desktop
To follow along you need your clone of cheese-app-v0, Docker Desktop,

17
00:00:57,591 --> 00:01:00,214
以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
and a Google Cloud project with billing.

18
00:01:00,534 --> 00:01:04,069
这一讲会真的发起付费的 Vertex AI 调用
This lecture makes real, paid calls to Vertex AI;

19
00:01:04,069 --> 00:01:09,408
每一处都有金色标签标出，视频最后会把一切都关掉
a gold tag marks each one, and the video ends by shutting everything down.

20
00:01:09,728 --> 00:01:15,062
左上角的进度条按六个阶段跟着 README 走，从准备一直到关闭
The tracker in the top left follows the README in six stages, from setup to shutdown.

21
00:01:15,382 --> 00:01:18,372
看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑一遍
A yellow your-turn tag means pause and run it,

22
00:01:18,372 --> 00:01:22,336
灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有
and a gray extra tag marks a check that is not in the README.

23
00:01:22,656 --> 00:01:25,664
每条命令都在学习指南里，链接在下方
Every command is in the study guide, linked below.

24
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:29,473
首先是地图，它会陪我们走完这一讲
First, the map, which stays with us all lecture.

25
00:01:29,793 --> 00:01:31,412
你的笔记本是一栋房子
Your laptop is one house,

26
00:01:31,412 --> 00:01:37,175
每栋房子都有自己的回环地址 localhost，它永远指这台机器
and every house has its own loopback address, localhost, which always means this machine.

27
00:01:37,495 --> 00:01:41,164
Docker 在里面铺了两条私有的街道，一个网络一条
Docker lays two private streets inside it, one per network.

28
00:01:41,484 --> 00:01:43,761
会有三个服务站在这些街上
Three services will stand on them:

29
00:01:43,761 --> 00:01:48,716
向量数据库和它的加载器、API 服务器，还有网页前端
the vector database with its loader, the API server, and the web frontend.

30
00:01:49,036 --> 00:01:51,596
每栋房子都会在它的 container 启动时亮起来
Each house lights up when its container starts.

31
00:01:51,833 --> 00:01:55,609
你的浏览器站在笔记本的地面上，不在任何一条街上
Your browser stands on the laptop floor, outside every street.

32
00:01:55,929 --> 00:01:59,940
公共街道对面是 Google 的大楼，门口有人把守
Across the public street sits Google's building, with a guarded door.

33
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:01,860
那么，谁打给谁？
Now, who calls whom?

34
00:02:01,966 --> 00:02:04,313
加载器打给 Google 和数据库
The loader calls Google and the database.

35
00:02:04,633 --> 00:02:06,382
API 打给 Google
The API calls Google.

36
00:02:06,702 --> 00:02:08,644
你的浏览器打给其余所有服务
Your browser calls everything else.

37
00:02:08,964 --> 00:02:13,529
而 API 从不和数据库说话；README 自己就是这么写的
And the API never talks to the database; the README says so itself.

38
00:02:13,849 --> 00:02:16,431
第二部分会讲为什么浏览器要干这么多活
Part 2 shows why the browser does so much.

39
00:02:16,667 --> 00:02:18,046
该动手敲了
Time to type.

40
00:02:18,096 --> 00:02:23,856
README 的前置条件很短：装好 Docker，再 clone 这个仓库
The README's prerequisites are short: have Docker installed, and clone this repository.

41
00:02:24,176 --> 00:02:27,803
README 没给地址，所以这里给出 repo 的地址
The README gives no address, so here is the repo's address.

42
00:02:28,123 --> 00:02:29,723
暂停一下，把它 clone 下来
Pause, and clone it.

43
00:02:32,633 --> 00:02:36,833
额外跑一下 git log，可以看到这个视频用的 commit
An extra git log shows the commit this video uses,

44
00:02:36,833 --> 00:02:38,764
日期是 2026 年 10 月 8 日
from October 8th, 2026;

45
00:02:38,764 --> 00:02:41,956
你的要是更新，细节可能不一样
if yours is newer, details may differ.

46
00:02:42,276 --> 00:02:43,623
再额外列一下目录
An extra listing

47
00:02:43,623 --> 00:02:47,573
llm-rag、api-service 和 frontend-ai-chatbot
shows llm-rag, api-service, and frontend-ai-chatbot:

48
00:02:47,573 --> 00:02:49,209
一栋房子一个目录
one folder per house.

49
00:02:49,450 --> 00:02:50,872
有一个小疏漏
One small gap.

50
00:02:50,922 --> 00:02:54,110
这个应用自己的主页上，动画演示的是一个托管版本
The app's own home page animates a hosted version,

51
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:56,469
Web 服务器跑在一台云端机器上
with a web server on a cloud machine.

52
00:02:56,789 --> 00:02:59,903
那套部署的文件已经从 repo 里删掉了
The files for that setup were deleted from the repo.

53
00:03:00,223 --> 00:03:04,490
你跑的是本地版本，而这张地图画的正是你跑的东西
You are running the local version, and this map draws exactly what you run.

54
00:03:05,533 --> 00:03:09,309
第二个前置条件是创建一个身份，但不是给你用的
The second prerequisite creates an identity, but not for you.

55
00:03:09,629 --> 00:03:12,509
服务账号就是给软件用的身份
A service account is an identity for software.

56
00:03:12,829 --> 00:03:17,437
它的邮箱就像这张工牌：llm-service-account，后面是你的项目
Its email looks like this badge: llm-service-account@your-gcp-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com.

57
00:03:17,757 --> 00:03:21,128
代码戴着它去调用 Google，不需要登录界面
Code wears it to call Google, with no login screen.

58
00:03:22,016 --> 00:03:24,981
按量计费的公开调用用 API key
A metered public call gets an API key.

59
00:03:25,301 --> 00:03:28,382
替一个同意授权的用户办事的应用，用 OAuth
An app acting for a consenting user gets OAuth,

60
00:03:28,382 --> 00:03:30,315
也就是用 Google 账号登录的那套流程
the Sign in with Google flow.

61
00:03:30,635 --> 00:03:35,392
我们的代码在你自己的项目里调用 Vertex AI，所以它用服务账号
Our code calls Vertex AI in your own project, so it gets a service account.

62
00:03:35,712 --> 00:03:40,149
规则最后一行说，Google 之外的代码应该用身份联合
The rule's last line says code outside Google should use federation.

63
00:03:40,469 --> 00:03:43,028
这需要有人为你的代码担保
That needs someone to vouch for your code,

64
00:03:43,028 --> 00:03:45,717
就像 GitHub 为 GitHub Actions 里的代码担保那样
as GitHub does for code in GitHub Actions.

65
00:03:46,037 --> 00:03:50,006
笔记本没有人来担保，所以课程改为直接给你一个密钥文件
A laptop has nobody, so the course hands you a key file instead.

66
00:03:50,250 --> 00:03:53,429
打开 IAM & Admin，再进 Service accounts
Open IAM & Admin, then Service accounts.

67
00:03:53,749 --> 00:03:56,266
建一个，名字叫 llm-service-account
Create one named llm-service-account.

68
00:03:56,586 --> 00:04:00,793
给它授予两个角色，也就是权限的集合：Storage Admin
Grant it two roles, bundles of permissions: Storage Admin,

69
00:04:00,793 --> 00:04:03,839
和 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform User
and Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform User.

70
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:09,685
第二个角色以前叫 Vertex AI User，本质上还是同一个角色
The second role was formerly called Vertex AI User; it is the same role underneath.

71
00:04:10,005 --> 00:04:11,605
暂停一下，建一个你自己的
Pause and create yours.

72
00:04:11,766 --> 00:04:13,366
关于课件，说两点
Two notes on the slides.

73
00:04:13,601 --> 00:04:17,547
课件里那个只有一个存储角色的演示账号，是下周的
The slides' demo account, with one storage role, is next week's.

74
00:04:17,867 --> 00:04:23,051
而且这个应用从来不碰存储；那个角色是从微调那一讲带过来的
And this app never touches storage; that role rides along from the fine-tuning lecture.

75
00:04:23,371 --> 00:04:25,910
不过两个都要授予，照 README 说的做
Grant both anyway, as the README says.

76
00:04:26,230 --> 00:04:30,366
课上的规则是最小权限，意思是只给你需要的权限
The lecture's rule, least privilege, meaning only the access you need,

77
00:04:30,366 --> 00:04:31,866
照它来会授予得更少
would grant less;

78
00:04:31,866 --> 00:04:33,466
第二部分还会回到这一点
part 2 comes back to it.

79
00:04:33,666 --> 00:04:36,268
在这个账号的 KEYS 标签页添加一个密钥
On the account's Keys tab, add a key,

80
00:04:36,268 --> 00:04:38,658
选 JSON，就会下载一个文件
choose JSON, and a file downloads.

81
00:04:38,978 --> 00:04:40,578
暂停一下，做一个你自己的
Pause and make yours.

82
00:04:40,706 --> 00:04:45,463
里面有你的项目、这个账号的邮箱、一个令牌地址，还有一个私钥
Inside are your project, the account's email, a token address, and a private key.

83
00:04:45,783 --> 00:04:48,087
这个私钥就是全部的秘密
That private key is the whole secret.

84
00:04:48,407 --> 00:04:50,875
它只是单一因素，属于你持有的东西
It is one factor, something you have:

85
00:04:50,875 --> 00:04:55,277
在哪儿都能用，不需要第二步，直到被删除或停用
it works anywhere, with no second step, until deleted or disabled.

86
00:04:55,597 --> 00:04:58,754
把这个文件当密码看待，绝不要当配置
Treat this file like a password, never like config.

87
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:03,043
README 说把密钥复制到一个 secrets 目录
The README says to copy the key into a secrets folder.

88
00:05:03,363 --> 00:05:07,181
哪一个？API 的脚本在第 8 行给出了答案
Which one? The API's script answers on line 8.

89
00:05:07,501 --> 00:05:10,637
路径从你运行它的地方开始，也就是 api-service
The path starts where you run it, in api-service.

90
00:05:10,957 --> 00:05:14,221
它往上爬两级，落在 secrets 目录
It climbs up twice and lands on the secrets folder,

91
00:05:14,221 --> 00:05:16,205
就在 repo 旁边，而不是里面
beside the repo, not inside it.

92
00:05:16,450 --> 00:05:20,364
接着，一个 -v 参数把这个宿主机目录挂载到 /secrets
Then a -v flag mounts that host folder at /secrets,

93
00:05:20,364 --> 00:05:21,975
在 container 里面
inside the container.

94
00:05:22,295 --> 00:05:25,356
Google application credentials 这个变量
The GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS variable,

95
00:05:25,356 --> 00:05:28,556
告诉 Google 的库密钥在哪儿
which tells Google's library where the key is,

96
00:05:28,556 --> 00:05:31,895
它指向 /secrets，一个 container 里的路径
points to /secrets, a path inside the container.

97
00:05:32,215 --> 00:05:37,442
两个文件系统，一个目录，而这个变量只有在挂载之后才有意义
Two filesystems, one folder, and that variable only makes sense after the mount.

98
00:05:37,683 --> 00:05:40,808
加载器的 compose 文件搭了同一个传送门
The loader's compose file builds the same portal

99
00:05:40,808 --> 00:05:43,998
从自己的目录出发：往上两级，同一个 secrets 目录
from its own folder: up two levels, same secrets.

100
00:05:44,318 --> 00:05:49,374
课件上的那一页只往上爬一级，因为它的 repo 浅一层
The lecture's slide climbs only once, because its repos sit one level shallower.

101
00:05:49,694 --> 00:05:52,403
永远要数清往上爬了几级，从脚本所在的位置数起
Always count the climbs from where the script sits.

102
00:05:52,650 --> 00:05:55,971
在你的 clone 旁边建好这个目录，这是额外步骤
Make the folder beside your clone, as an extra,

103
00:05:55,971 --> 00:06:00,565
然后把下载的文件移进去，改名为 llm-service-account.json
then move the download in and rename it llm-service-account.json.

104
00:06:00,885 --> 00:06:05,557
检查一下名字：隐藏的扩展名可能让它变成 .json.json
Check that name: hidden extensions can leave .json.json.

105
00:06:05,877 --> 00:06:08,735
额外用 tree 看一下，是 README 里的目录结构
An extra tree view shows the README's layout.

106
00:06:09,055 --> 00:06:10,655
暂停一下，把你的也摆成这样
Pause and match it.

107
00:06:16,917 --> 00:06:18,317
接下来是一个不显眼的陷阱
Now a quiet trap:

108
00:06:18,317 --> 00:06:21,567
这个 repo 的 .gitignore 里没有任何关于 secrets 的规则
the repo's gitignore has no rule for secrets.

109
00:06:21,617 --> 00:06:24,191
没有任何东西保护放在 repo 里面的密钥
Nothing protects a key inside the repo.

110
00:06:24,433 --> 00:06:26,033
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

111
00:06:26,097 --> 00:06:31,507
假设你把密钥存在 repo 里面，也就是 cheese-app-v0/secrets
Suppose you save the key inside the repo, in cheese-app-v0/secrets,

112
00:06:31,507 --> 00:06:34,737
然后在 api-service 里运行 API 脚本
and run the API script from api-service.

113
00:06:35,057 --> 00:06:39,239
这时 /secrets 里有什么，第一次 embedding 调用又会怎样？
What is in /secrets, and what happens on the first embedding call?

114
00:06:48,083 --> 00:06:52,072
路径还是往上爬两级，爬到一个不存在的目录
The cursor still climbs twice, to a folder that does not exist.

115
00:06:52,392 --> 00:06:56,744
Docker 不会抱怨；它会悄悄地创建这个目录，空的
Docker does not complain; it silently creates that folder, empty.

116
00:06:57,064 --> 00:07:01,159
所以 /secrets 是空的，第一次 embedding 调用会失败
So /secrets is empty, and the first embedding call fails

117
00:07:01,159 --> 00:07:04,595
报 DefaultCredentialsError：找不到文件
with a DefaultCredentialsError: file not found.

118
00:07:04,915 --> 00:07:08,499
而你的密钥正躺在一个没有任何保护的 git 目录树里
Meanwhile your key sits in a git tree that nothing protects.

119
00:07:09,533 --> 00:07:12,200
最后一个前置条件：Docker 网络
Last prerequisite: the Docker network.

120
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:17,298
README 的命令先悄悄检查它，只有检查失败才创建
The README's command inspects it quietly, and creates it only if that fails.

121
00:07:17,618 --> 00:07:18,966
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

122
00:07:19,016 --> 00:07:21,747
额外再跑一次会怎样？
What happens if you run it again, as an extra?

123
00:07:22,067 --> 00:07:24,669
什么都不会发生：不报错，也不会多出第二个网络
Nothing: no error, no second network.

124
00:07:24,989 --> 00:07:28,616
一条跑两次也安全的命令，叫作幂等的
A command that is safe to run twice is called idempotent.

125
00:07:28,936 --> 00:07:30,383
记住这个套路
Remember this shape.

126
00:07:30,433 --> 00:07:34,014
在 llm-rag 里，shell 脚本自带一个默认项目
In llm-rag, the shell script ships with a default project

127
00:07:34,014 --> 00:07:35,614
而那不是你的项目
that is not yours.

128
00:07:35,681 --> 00:07:39,634
把 GCP project 这个变量改成你自己的项目 ID
Update the GCP_PROJECT variable to your own project ID;

129
00:07:39,634 --> 00:07:42,508
我们用 sed，你用任何编辑器都行
we use the sed tool, you use any editor.

130
00:07:42,828 --> 00:07:44,428
暂停一下，改好它
Pause and edit it.

131
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:48,419
现在是 README 的命令：sh docker-shell.sh
Now the README's command: sh docker-shell.sh.

132
00:07:48,739 --> 00:07:50,161
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

133
00:07:50,211 --> 00:07:51,711
Compose 拉取 Chroma
Compose pulls Chroma,

134
00:07:51,711 --> 00:07:56,397
创建一个叫 llm-rag-network 的网络，然后在上面启动数据库
creates a network called llm-rag-network, and starts the database on it.

135
00:07:56,717 --> 00:07:59,811
这个文件里的每个服务都会自动加入它
Every service in this file joins it automatically.

136
00:08:00,131 --> 00:08:03,446
那行 pull access denied 是无害的
The line that says pull access denied is harmless:

137
00:08:03,446 --> 00:08:07,555
这个 image 不在 Docker Hub 上，所以 Compose 在本地构建它
that image is not on Docker Hub, so Compose builds it locally.

138
00:08:07,875 --> 00:08:11,451
这里 container 的架构是 x86
The container's architecture is x86 here;

139
00:08:11,451 --> 00:08:13,805
Apple Silicon 上会显示 aarch64
Apple Silicon says aarch64.

140
00:08:14,050 --> 00:08:15,842
在里面做两个额外检查
Two extra checks inside.

141
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:19,575
密钥文件出现在 /secrets 里，是穿过传送门来的
The key file shows up in /secrets, through the portal.

142
00:08:19,895 --> 00:08:24,233
两个变量也都设好了，是 Compose 从启动它的脚本那里复制过来的
And both variables are set, copied by Compose from the launching script,

143
00:08:24,233 --> 00:08:26,402
所以永远要从这个脚本启动
which is why you always start there.

144
00:08:26,650 --> 00:08:28,954
关于这次录制，如实说一句
One honest note about this recording.

145
00:08:29,274 --> 00:08:31,471
这台机器没有 Google 账号
This machine has no Google account.

146
00:08:31,791 --> 00:08:35,653
你刚才看到的密钥文件，是一个明显无效的替身
The key file you just saw is an obviously invalid stand-in.

147
00:08:35,973 --> 00:08:41,498
放它是为了让目录列表和 README 对得上，云端步骤之前就删掉了
It is there so the folder listings match the README, and it was removed before the cloud steps.

148
00:08:41,818 --> 00:08:44,898
所以从这里开始，每个云端调用的失败方式
So from here on, every cloud call fails exactly the way a missing key fails.

149
00:08:44,898 --> 00:08:46,746
都和缺少密钥时一模一样
So from here on, every cloud call fails exactly the way a missing key fails.

150
00:08:47,066 --> 00:08:50,949
这是这一讲最常见的错误，所以一眼就要认出来
It is the most common mistake in this lecture, so learn it on sight.

151
00:08:51,269 --> 00:08:55,194
你接下来该看到的每一个成功结果，都标着 recorded，并注明出处
Every success you should expect is tagged recorded, with its source.

152
00:08:56,233 --> 00:09:00,469
进了 container，README 的第一条命令做三件事
Inside the container, the README's first command does three jobs:

153
00:09:00,469 --> 00:09:03,401
用 char-split 分块、向量化、加载
it chunks, embeds and loads, with char-split.

154
00:09:03,721 --> 00:09:06,324
提示符里的 ID 每次运行都会变
The ID in the prompt changes every run.

155
00:09:06,644 --> 00:09:11,977
分块是真的跑了：11 本书，Tolminc 那本书切成了 24 个 chunk
Chunking runs for real: 11 books, and the Tolminc book becomes 24 chunks.

156
00:09:12,216 --> 00:09:13,816
先看一个金色标签
A gold tag first.

157
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:17,955
向量化这一步会把每个 chunk 发给 Google 的 embedding 模型
The embed step sends every chunk to Google's embedding model,

158
00:09:17,955 --> 00:09:22,029
两次运行加起来大约 700 万个字符，这是我们的估算
about 7 million characters across both runs, by our estimate.

159
00:09:22,349 --> 00:09:25,635
这会向你的项目计费；请查看当前的价目页
That bills your project; check the current pricing page.

160
00:09:25,883 --> 00:09:29,851
向量化这一步在构建名为 Authorization 的请求头时停了下来
The embed step stops while building the header named Authorization.

161
00:09:30,171 --> 00:09:31,171
别看它叫这个名字
Despite the name,

162
00:09:31,171 --> 00:09:33,953
它装的其实是你的身份证明，也就是一个 bearer token
it carries proof of who you are, a bearer token,

163
00:09:33,953 --> 00:09:35,262
而这需要密钥
which needs a key.

164
00:09:35,312 --> 00:09:38,811
DefaultCredentialsError：找不到密钥文件
DefaultCredentialsError: the key file was not found.

165
00:09:39,131 --> 00:09:43,910
没有密钥就没有令牌：第一个云端请求死在了身份验证这一步
No key, no token: the first cloud request dies at authentication.

166
00:09:44,230 --> 00:09:46,000
下一段就来搭这条链
The next scene builds that chain.

167
00:09:46,250 --> 00:09:48,594
有真实密钥的话，运行会继续
With a real key, the run continues:

168
00:09:48,594 --> 00:09:53,951
向量化每一本书，创建 char-split-collection，最后完成插入
it embeds every book, creates the char-split-collection, and finishes inserting.

169
00:09:54,271 --> 00:09:57,173
暂停一下，自己跑一遍；用你的密钥，这要花一阵子
Pause and run it; with your key, it takes a while.

170
00:09:57,493 --> 00:10:04,240
如果你看到的是 403，说 API 没有启用，就启用 Vertex AI API
If instead you see a 403 saying the API is disabled, enable the Vertex AI API;

171
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:07,007
讲 IAM 的那一段会给出命令
the IAM scene shows the command.

172
00:10:07,250 --> 00:10:10,578
第二条命令用 recursive-split 做同样的事
The second command does the same with recursive-split.

173
00:10:10,898 --> 00:10:13,138
暂停一下，自己跑一遍，然后输入 exit
Pause and run it, then type exit.

174
00:10:13,458 --> 00:10:18,286
额外数一下：char-split 有 8248 个 chunk
An extra count shows 8,248 chunks for char-split

175
00:10:18,286 --> 00:10:24,018
recursive-split 有 14228 个，这是录制时的数字
and 14,228 for recursive-split, at the time of recording.

176
00:10:24,338 --> 00:10:26,638
递归切分产生的 chunk 更多
Recursive split makes more chunks,

177
00:10:26,638 --> 00:10:30,290
主要是因为默认最多 200 个字符的重叠
mostly from a default overlap of up to 200 characters,

178
00:10:30,290 --> 00:10:33,063
而且它在段落和单词之间的断点处切
and it cuts at paragraph and word breaks.

179
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:36,564
这些 chunk 文件通过 /app 这个挂载落到你的笔记本上
The chunk files land on your laptop through the app mount.

180
00:10:36,884 --> 00:10:38,484
这里有一个小疏漏
One small slip shows here.

181
00:10:38,804 --> 00:10:42,928
书名在第一个点处被截断了，所以它的 chunk 没有作者
A book title is cut at its first dot, so its chunks get no author,

182
00:10:42,928 --> 00:10:45,865
agent 的作者过滤永远找不到它们
and the agent's author filter never finds them.

183
00:10:46,185 --> 00:10:48,809
修法是一个 Python 函数：splitext
The fix is a Python function, splitext.

184
00:10:49,129 --> 00:10:51,178
最后，看一个真实的 Tolminc chunk
Last, one real Tolminc chunk:

185
00:10:51,178 --> 00:10:54,356
就是对话交给 Gemini 的那种段落
the kind of passage the chat hands to Gemini.

186
00:10:55,800 --> 00:11:00,095
README 说 ChromaDB 在你退出之后还会继续跑
The README says ChromaDB keeps running after you exit,

187
00:11:00,095 --> 00:11:03,992
额外跑一下 docker ps 就能确认，就在 port 8000 上
and an extra docker ps confirms it, on port 8000.

188
00:11:04,312 --> 00:11:10,435
再额外 curl 一下它的版本：录制时是 1.0.0
An extra curl asks for its version: 1.0.0, at the time of recording.

189
00:11:10,755 --> 00:11:12,653
关掉它放在最后
Stopping it comes at the very end.

190
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:16,922
那么，到底是什么失败了？
So what failed?

191
00:11:16,972 --> 00:11:19,858
加载器的 Google 客户端和 API 的一样
The loader's Google client, like the API's,

192
00:11:19,858 --> 00:11:23,415
只用一个项目和一个区域来构建，别的什么都没有
is built from a project and a location, nothing else.

193
00:11:23,735 --> 00:11:26,883
这个 repo 里没有代码去打开密钥文件
No code in this repo opens the key file;

194
00:11:26,883 --> 00:11:33,100
打开它的是一个库，靠的是一个叫应用默认凭据的约定，简称 ADC
a library does, by a convention called application default credentials, or ADC.

195
00:11:33,333 --> 00:11:35,936
ADC 按顺序看三个位置
ADC looks in three places, in order.

196
00:11:36,256 --> 00:11:40,909
第一，Google application credentials 这个变量指定的文件
First, the file named by the GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS variable:

197
00:11:40,909 --> 00:11:43,808
一个服务账号密钥，就像这个教程里的
a service account key, as in this tutorial.

198
00:11:44,128 --> 00:11:48,842
第二，gcloud 工具为你本人写的一个登录文件
Second, a login file the gcloud tool writes for you, as a person.

199
00:11:49,162 --> 00:11:53,706
第三，元数据服务器，在你的代码跑在 Google 的云里时才有
Third, the metadata server, when your code runs inside Google's cloud.

200
00:11:54,026 --> 00:11:58,400
ADC 转到下一个位置，只有一种情况：前一个没有设置
ADC moves to the next place only when the one before is not set.

201
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:02,240
在这些 container 里，只有第一个位置存在
Inside these containers, only the first place exists.

202
00:12:02,483 --> 00:12:06,814
这个库写一张小纸条，也就是一个 JSON Web Token
The library writes a small note, a JSON Web Token, and signs it with your private key.

203
00:12:06,814 --> 00:12:08,414
用你的私钥签名
The library writes a small note, a JSON Web Token, and signs it with your private key.

204
00:12:08,563 --> 00:12:11,081
它把这张纸条送到 Google 的令牌柜台
It sends that note to Google's token desk,

205
00:12:11,081 --> 00:12:13,000
地址就写在你的密钥文件里
at the address in your key file.

206
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,469
Google 手里有配对的公钥
Google holds the matching public key,

207
00:12:15,469 --> 00:12:19,187
所以不用看到私钥，就能验证你的签名
so it checks your signature without ever seeing the private one.

208
00:12:19,507 --> 00:12:22,878
换回来的是一个访问令牌，有效期大约一小时
Back comes an access token, valid for about an hour.

209
00:12:23,198 --> 00:12:26,526
这个令牌跟着每个请求走，作为 bearer 请求头
That token rides on every request as a bearer header.

210
00:12:26,846 --> 00:12:31,646
你的私钥从不离开你的电脑；在路上跑的只有那张短期有效的票
Your private key never leaves your machine; only the short-lived ticket travels.

211
00:12:31,883 --> 00:12:34,848
一小时用完，库会再换一个新的
When the hour runs out, the library gets a new one.

212
00:12:35,168 --> 00:12:38,716
课上那张 OAuth 图也终止在同一个柜台
The lecture's OAuth diagram ends at this same desk,

213
00:12:38,716 --> 00:12:41,846
只是少了授权同意页面：这里没有人
minus the consent screen: no person is there.

214
00:12:42,083 --> 00:12:44,152
来看 ADC 被抓个现行
Here is ADC caught in the act.

215
00:12:44,472 --> 00:12:46,149
在 /secrets 为空的情况下
With /secrets empty,

216
00:12:46,149 --> 00:12:50,424
额外用一行 Python 检查问 ADC 我们是谁
an extra one-line Python check asks ADC who we are.

217
00:12:50,744 --> 00:12:53,772
变量设了，所以 ADC 打开那个路径
The variable is set, so ADC opens that path,

218
00:12:53,772 --> 00:12:57,763
找不到文件，就停在那里，报同一个错误
finds no file, and stops right there, with the same error.

219
00:12:58,083 --> 00:13:01,390
错误的路径永远不会退回到另外两个位置
A wrong path never falls back to the other two places.

220
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:05,209
密钥放好了，它就会说出你的服务账号
With your key in place, it names your service account instead.

221
00:13:05,450 --> 00:13:08,870
一个常见的误解：在你的 Mac 上设这个变量
One common mix-up: setting that variable on your Mac

222
00:13:08,870 --> 00:13:13,343
对 container 里面的身份验证毫无作用，那里这个路径必须存在
authenticates nothing inside a container, where the path must exist.

223
00:13:13,663 --> 00:13:18,293
所以脚本设的是 container 里的路径，再单独挂载宿主机目录
That is why the scripts set a container path, and mount the host folder separately.

224
00:13:19,617 --> 00:13:21,942
身份验证证明了你的代码是谁
Authentication proved who your code is.

225
00:13:22,262 --> 00:13:25,142
授权决定它能做什么，在哪里做
Authorization decides what it may do, and where.

226
00:13:25,462 --> 00:13:30,476
Google 把这叫 IAM：一个由身份、角色和资源组成的格子
Google calls this IAM: a grid of identities, roles, and resources.

227
00:13:30,796 --> 00:13:34,808
你的服务账号在你的项目里持有 Gemini 用户这个角色
Your service account holds the Gemini user role in your project,

228
00:13:34,808 --> 00:13:36,940
真正起作用的是那个绿色的格子
and that green cell does the work.

229
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:41,612
Storage Admin 在它旁边，授予了，但这个应用从来没用过
Storage Admin sits beside it, granted but never used by this app.

230
00:13:41,850 --> 00:13:43,791
三个请求检验三个格子
Three requests test three cells.

231
00:13:44,111 --> 00:13:46,442
IAM 检查的是请求里点名的资源
IAM checks the resource the request names;

232
00:13:46,442 --> 00:13:47,929
对 embedding 来说
for an embedding,

233
00:13:47,929 --> 00:13:51,365
这个名字是客户端根据你的 GCP project 这个变量写出来的
the client writes that name from your project variable.

234
00:13:51,685 --> 00:13:54,074
在你自己项目里的 embedding 是允许的
An embedding in your own project is allowed.

235
00:13:54,394 --> 00:13:58,221
同样的调用换成脚本里没改过的默认项目
The same call with the script's unedited default project

236
00:13:58,221 --> 00:14:02,458
会以 403 被拒绝，因为你的账号在那里没有角色
is refused with a 403, because your account has no role there.

237
00:14:02,778 --> 00:14:04,634
所以两个脚本都要改
That is why you edit both scripts.

238
00:14:04,954 --> 00:14:07,066
第三根箭头留到第二部分
The third arrow waits for part 2.

239
00:14:07,300 --> 00:14:09,857
DefaultCredentialsError 或者 401
A DefaultCredentialsError, or a 401,

240
00:14:09,857 --> 00:14:14,617
意思是没有有效的令牌：检查路径、挂载和文件名
means no valid token: check the path, the mount, and the file name.

241
00:14:14,937 --> 00:14:19,204
403 的意思是身份验证通过了，但授权失败了
A 403 means authentication worked, but authorization failed.

242
00:14:19,524 --> 00:14:24,879
原因：缺了角色、项目不对，或者 API 没有启用
The cause: a missing role, the wrong project, or an API that is not enabled.

243
00:14:25,117 --> 00:14:27,536
最后这个原因是一个小疏漏
That last cause is a small gap:

244
00:14:27,536 --> 00:14:31,282
这里没有哪个 README 说要启用 Vertex AI API
no README here says to enable the Vertex AI API.

245
00:14:31,602 --> 00:14:34,272
如果你从没启用过，403 会直接说出来
If you never did, the 403 says so,

246
00:14:34,272 --> 00:14:37,256
一条额外的 gcloud 命令就能修好
and one extra gcloud command fixes it.

247
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:39,100
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

248
00:14:39,164 --> 00:14:41,058
你的密钥用来做 embedding 没问题
Your key works for embeddings.

249
00:14:41,191 --> 00:14:43,660
现在你贴上授课老师的 endpoint
Now you paste the instructor's endpoint,

250
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:46,439
它以 projects 和一长串数字开头
which begins with projects and a long number.

251
00:14:46,759 --> 00:14:49,578
哪一部分决定检查谁的 IAM
Which part decides whose IAM is checked:

252
00:14:49,578 --> 00:14:54,652
GCP project 这个变量、密钥里的项目，还是 endpoint 路径？
the project variable, the project inside your key, or the endpoint path?

253
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:08,535
是路径。不是密钥里的项目：那只说明工牌是在哪儿签发的
The path. Not the key's project: that only says where the badge was issued.

254
00:15:08,855 --> 00:15:09,956
也不是那个变量
Not the variable:

255
00:15:09,956 --> 00:15:13,975
endpoint 路径本身已经点名了一个项目，以这个名字为准
the endpoint path already names a project, and that name wins.

256
00:15:14,295 --> 00:15:19,280
那是别人的项目，你的账号在那里没有角色，所以是 403
It is someone else's project, where your account has no role, so it is a 403;

257
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:20,880
第二部分会把它画出来
part 2 draws it.

258
00:15:25,067 --> 00:15:27,584
第一部分的最后一段：API
Last stretch of part 1, the API.

259
00:15:27,904 --> 00:15:32,022
在 api-service 目录里，做第二处项目名的修改
In the api-service folder, make the second project-name edit.

260
00:15:32,342 --> 00:15:33,942
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

261
00:15:34,917 --> 00:15:38,586
然后是 README 的命令：sh docker-shell.sh
Then the README's command, sh docker-shell.sh.

262
00:15:38,906 --> 00:15:40,328
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

263
00:15:40,378 --> 00:15:43,258
它马上就挂了：网络已经存在
It dies at once: the network already exists.

264
00:15:43,684 --> 00:15:46,863
这是这个 repo 里最大的疏漏，不是你的错
This is the biggest slip in the repo, and not your fault.

265
00:15:47,183 --> 00:15:50,427
第 14 行无条件地创建网络
Line 14 creates the network unconditionally,

266
00:15:50,427 --> 00:15:54,777
而第 4 行的 set -e 会让脚本在第一个错误处停下
and set -e, on line 4, stops the script at the first error.

267
00:15:55,097 --> 00:15:57,618
所以它一碰到网络已经存在就会失败
So it fails whenever the network exists,

268
00:15:57,618 --> 00:16:00,580
哪怕刚跑完 README 自己建网络的那一步
even right after the README's own network step.

269
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:03,392
修法就是前面见过的那个套路
The fix is the shape you met earlier:

270
00:16:03,392 --> 00:16:06,895
把第 14 行换成 README 那条先检查、不存在再创建的命令
make line 14 the README's inspect-or-create command.

271
00:16:07,215 --> 00:16:11,353
暂停一下，在你的编辑器里改好；sed 是我们的做法，算额外步骤
Pause and make that edit in your editor; the sed is ours, an extra.

272
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,171
再跑一次脚本
Run the script again.

273
00:16:13,221 --> 00:16:17,637
第一次构建会从 Pipfile.lock 安装 170 个 pin 住的包
The first build installs 170 pinned packages from Pipfile.lock,

274
00:16:17,637 --> 00:16:21,563
这在录制时花了大约三分钟
which took about three minutes at the time of recording.

275
00:16:21,883 --> 00:16:23,611
你会进到 pipenv shell 里
You land in the pipenv shell.

276
00:16:23,931 --> 00:16:26,249
输入 uvicorn server
Type uvicorn_server,

277
00:16:26,249 --> 00:16:32,507
API 就在 port 9000 上启动，监听 0.0.0.0
and the API starts on port 9000, listening on 0.0.0.0.

278
00:16:32,827 --> 00:16:34,427
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

279
00:16:37,017 --> 00:16:40,522
服务器在 secrets 目录为空的情况下也顺利启动了
The server started cleanly with an empty secrets folder,

280
00:16:40,522 --> 00:16:45,529
因为 Google 客户端要到第一个请求时才去找凭据
because the Google client does not look for credentials until its first request.

281
00:16:45,849 --> 00:16:47,299
在第二个终端里
In a second terminal,

282
00:16:47,299 --> 00:16:50,820
额外用 curl 请求一个 embedding，得到的是 500
an extra curl asks for an embedding and gets a 500.

283
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:54,387
服务器日志里是同一个 DefaultCredentialsError
The server log shows the same DefaultCredentialsError,

284
00:16:54,387 --> 00:16:56,793
在构建 bearer 请求头时抛出
raised while building the bearer header.

285
00:16:57,113 --> 00:17:00,270
启动是绿的，不代表身份验证过了
A green startup is not an authenticated startup.

286
00:17:00,850 --> 00:17:05,537
有真实密钥的话，同样的请求会返回一个 256 个数的列表
With a real key, the same request returns a list of 256 numbers,

287
00:17:05,537 --> 00:17:07,137
也就是 embedding
the embedding.

288
00:17:07,357 --> 00:17:11,218
这个长度必须和加载器的一致，否则数据库查询会失败
That length must match the loader's, or the database queries fail.

289
00:17:11,538 --> 00:17:14,461
整条链也会一路亮起来，一直到 200
And the whole chain lights up, through to a 200.

290
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:16,994
README 在这里的最后一步
The README's last step here:

291
00:17:16,994 --> 00:17:20,353
在浏览器里打开 localhost:9000/docs
open localhost:9000/docs in your browser.

292
00:17:20,673 --> 00:17:22,031
暂停一下，看一看
Pause and look.

293
00:17:22,081 --> 00:17:25,832
额外跑几次 curl，能看到文档页和 README 里的五个路由
Extra curls show the docs page and the README's five routes,

294
00:17:25,832 --> 00:17:27,458
外加根路径上的一个
plus one more at the root.

295
00:17:30,417 --> 00:17:32,641
在你的机器上，有真实密钥的话
On your machine, with a real key,

296
00:17:32,641 --> 00:17:37,158
身份验证的链条现在就完整了，API 在你的笔记本上应答
the auth chain is now complete, and the API answers on your laptop.

297
00:17:37,478 --> 00:17:38,836
让它一直跑着
Leave it running.

298
00:17:38,886 --> 00:17:40,756
第二部分问两个问题
Part 2 asks two questions:

299
00:17:40,756 --> 00:17:44,497
网页怎么找到这个 API，还有谁也能找到它？
how does a web page find this API, and who else can?

300
00:17:46,733 --> 00:17:51,021
第二部分从地址讲起；这一段的每条命令都是额外的
Part 2 starts with addresses; every command in this scene is an extra.

301
00:17:51,341 --> 00:17:56,909
加载器按名字拨数据库：llm-rag-chromadb:8000
The loader dials the database by name: llm-rag-chromadb:8000.

302
00:17:57,229 --> 00:18:02,050
你的浏览器会打给 localhost:8000，穿过笔记本墙上的一扇门
Your browser will ring localhost:8000, through a door in the laptop wall.

303
00:18:02,370 --> 00:18:04,162
一个服务器，两个地址
One server, two addresses.

304
00:18:04,482 --> 00:18:06,082
为什么它们不能互换？
Why can they not swap?

305
00:18:06,150 --> 00:18:09,649
每个 container 都是自己的一栋房子，有自己的 localhost
Each container is its own house, with its own localhost.

306
00:18:09,969 --> 00:18:13,403
在 container 里面，localhost 指的就是这个 container
Inside a container, localhost means that container.

307
00:18:13,723 --> 00:18:17,414
名字靠的是 Docker DNS，也就是每条街上的一本电话簿
Names work through Docker DNS, a phone book on each street.

308
00:18:17,734 --> 00:18:21,894
IP 地址在 container 重启时会变，名字却不会
IP addresses change when containers restart, but names do not.

309
00:18:22,214 --> 00:18:26,481
这次额外的 inspect 显示了 API 在它那条街上的 IP 地址
This extra inspect shows the API's IP address on its street.

310
00:18:26,801 --> 00:18:31,430
你的会不一样，这正是重点：拨名字，不要拨 IP 地址
Yours will differ, which is the point: dial names, not IP addresses.

311
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:35,485
而你的笔记本不在任何一条街上，所以它没有电话簿
And your laptop is not on any street, so it has no phone book:

312
00:18:35,485 --> 00:18:37,894
这个名字对你的浏览器毫无意义
that name means nothing to your browser.

313
00:18:38,133 --> 00:18:39,448
现在来证明
Now the proof.

314
00:18:39,498 --> 00:18:43,744
从 API container 里面，按名字问数据库
From inside the API container, ask for the database by name.

315
00:18:44,064 --> 00:18:46,666
回答是：Name or service not known
The answer: Name or service not known.

316
00:18:46,986 --> 00:18:50,058
API 那条街的电话簿里，没有这个名字的条目
The API's street has no entry for that name.

317
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:51,900
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

318
00:18:51,964 --> 00:18:55,676
假设你想让 API 自己去查询数据库
Suppose you want the API itself to query the database.

319
00:18:55,996 --> 00:19:00,497
它会用什么地址，地图上又要改什么，这个名字才能解析？
What address would it use, and what must change on the map for that name to resolve?

320
00:19:09,333 --> 00:19:12,191
把数据库也放到 API 那条街上，用一条额外的命令
Put the database on the API's street as well,

321
00:19:12,191 --> 00:19:17,653
docker network connect，同一个名字就会答出 Chroma 的版本
with an extra docker network connect, and the same name answers with Chroma's version.

322
00:19:17,973 --> 00:19:20,405
Docker DNS 在共用的街道上就管用
Docker DNS works on a shared street.

323
00:19:20,725 --> 00:19:24,181
那在 API 里面访问 localhost:8000 呢？
And localhost:8000, from inside the API?

324
00:19:24,501 --> 00:19:26,101
Connection refused
Connection refused.

325
00:19:26,229 --> 00:19:29,813
在 API 里面，8000 上没有任何东西在监听
Inside the API, nothing listens on 8000.

326
00:19:30,050 --> 00:19:32,951
然后把它断开：刚才只是个实验
Then disconnect it: that was only an experiment.

327
00:19:33,271 --> 00:19:35,577
这个应用里没有任何东西需要这条捷径
Nothing in this app needs that shortcut,

328
00:19:35,577 --> 00:19:37,709
因为每个调用都是浏览器发的
because the browser makes every call.

329
00:19:38,029 --> 00:19:42,039
有一个小疏漏：前端的配置还在把 docs 路径
One small slip: the frontend's config still forwards its docs

330
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:45,325
转发给一个这里并不存在的 container 名
path to a container name that does not exist here.

331
00:19:45,645 --> 00:19:51,404
API 文档请用 localhost:9000/docs，照 README 说的
For the API docs, use localhost:9000/docs, as the README says.

332
00:19:52,950 --> 00:19:57,537
让 API 继续跑着，在前端目录里打开一个新终端
Leave the API running, and open a new terminal in the frontend folder.

333
00:19:57,857 --> 00:20:00,182
运行它的 shell 脚本；暂停一下，照着做
Run its shell script; pause and do it.

334
00:20:00,502 --> 00:20:04,926
这个 image 只有 Node 和一个 shell，所以 npm 要你自己跑
The image holds just Node and a shell, so you run npm yourself;

335
00:20:04,926 --> 00:20:07,243
井号表示你是 root
the hash sign means you are root.

336
00:20:07,483 --> 00:20:15,206
接着是 npm install：录制时装了 773 个包，外加一些弃用警告
Then npm install: 773 packages at the time of recording, plus deprecation warnings.

337
00:20:15,526 --> 00:20:17,789
它们通过挂载落到你的目录里
They land in your folder through the mount,

338
00:20:17,789 --> 00:20:21,051
所以我们录制时可以退出再进来，也不会丢
so our capture could step out and back in without losing them.

339
00:20:21,371 --> 00:20:23,035
然后运行：npm run dev
Then npm run dev.

340
00:20:23,355 --> 00:20:29,059
Next.js 服务器显示 Ready，录制时版本是 14.2.4
The Next.js server says ready, version 14.2.4 at the time of recording,

341
00:20:29,059 --> 00:20:34,683
还打印出那行谁都会上当的：Local: http://localhost:3000
and prints the line that fools everyone: Local: http://localhost:3000.

342
00:20:35,003 --> 00:20:36,500
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

343
00:20:36,550 --> 00:20:39,153
在第二个终端里，做三个额外检查
In a second terminal, three extra checks.

344
00:20:39,473 --> 00:20:43,825
先预测一下：在你的笔记本上，localhost:3000 会有回应吗？
First, predict: will localhost:3000 answer from your laptop?

345
00:20:44,145 --> 00:20:45,873
不会，连不上
No, it fails to connect.

346
00:20:46,193 --> 00:20:50,374
从你的笔记本访问 localhost:3200，回应的是 RAG 应用
From your laptop, localhost:3200 answers with the RAG app.

347
00:20:50,694 --> 00:20:55,707
而在 container 里面，localhost:3000 回应的是同一个页面
And from inside the container, localhost:3000 answers with the same page.

348
00:20:56,027 --> 00:21:01,318
现在在浏览器里打开 localhost:3200；README 建议用 Chrome
Now open localhost:3200 in your browser; the README suggests Chrome.

349
00:21:01,638 --> 00:21:02,917
暂停一下，看一看
Pause and look.

350
00:21:02,967 --> 00:21:04,474
这就是隧道
That is the tunnel.

351
00:21:04,524 --> 00:21:07,832
参数 -p 3200:3000 的意思是
The flag -p 3200:3000 means

352
00:21:07,832 --> 00:21:13,591
host port 3200 转发到 container port 3000
host port 3200 forwards to container port 3000.

353
00:21:13,911 --> 00:21:17,935
Next.js 服务器在它自己的房子里监听 3000
The Next server listens on 3000 inside its own house,

354
00:21:17,935 --> 00:21:20,972
而你的浏览器在外面敲 3200 的门
and your browser knocks on 3200 outside.

355
00:21:21,292 --> 00:21:23,084
一个服务器，两个地址
One server, two addresses.

356
00:21:23,404 --> 00:21:26,177
额外跑一下 docker ps，能看到同一扇门
An extra docker ps shows the same door.

357
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:29,013
所有 port 号分成三段
Port numbers come in three bands.

358
00:21:29,333 --> 00:21:33,451
低段的属于系统，比如 80 和 443
The low ones belong to the system, like 80 and 443.

359
00:21:33,771 --> 00:21:39,979
你自己的从中段挑：3000、3200、8000 和 9000
Pick yours from the middle band: 3000, 3200, 8000, and 9000.

360
00:21:40,299 --> 00:21:43,669
高段放的是出站调用用的临时 port
The top band holds throw-away ports for outgoing calls.

361
00:21:43,917 --> 00:21:49,826
0.0.0.0 已经出现两次了，说的是两件不同的事
0.0.0.0 has now appeared twice, as two different facts.

362
00:21:50,146 --> 00:21:54,176
在 container 里面，隧道到达的是临街的一侧
Inside the container, the tunnel arrives at the street side,

363
00:21:54,176 --> 00:21:58,274
而不是回环接口，所以 API 服务器在每一侧都监听
not at the loopback, so the API server listens on every side.

364
00:21:58,594 --> 00:22:03,117
Docker 会在你笔记本的每一侧都发布，除非你加一个前缀
Docker publishes on every side of your laptop, unless you add a prefix.

365
00:22:03,437 --> 00:22:08,016
讲 port 的那一讲在 port 前面写了 127.0.0.1
The ports lecture wrote 127.0.0.1 before its port,

366
00:22:08,016 --> 00:22:10,306
这个应用却没写
but this app writes none.

367
00:22:10,626 --> 00:22:15,042
所以这些门也朝着你的 Wi-Fi，同一个网络上的任何人都能来敲门
So these doors face your Wi-Fi too, and anyone on that network can knock.

368
00:22:15,362 --> 00:22:21,335
在 host port 前面加上 127.0.0.1，就能关上那一侧
Adding 127.0.0.1 before the host port closes that side.

369
00:22:22,983 --> 00:22:27,099
这个配置被打包进浏览器下载的 JavaScript 里
This setting, baked into the JavaScript your browser downloads,

370
00:22:27,099 --> 00:22:29,255
告诉页面 API 的地址
gives the page the API's address.

371
00:22:29,575 --> 00:22:32,527
所以它必须是你的浏览器能访问到的地址
So it must be one your browser can reach:

372
00:22:32,527 --> 00:22:35,335
localhost:9000，绝不能是 container 名
localhost:9000, never a container name.

373
00:22:35,583 --> 00:22:39,743
5 步里的第 1 步是文本分块，在你的浏览器里跑，不产生费用
Step 1 of 5, text chunking, runs in your browser, with no bill.

374
00:22:40,063 --> 00:22:44,500
第 2 步是数据库界面，连到 localhost:8000
Step 2, the database UI, connects to localhost:8000.

375
00:22:44,820 --> 00:22:46,420
暂停一下，两个都试试
Pause and try both.

376
00:22:46,506 --> 00:22:50,196
我们额外列出来的是空的；你的会显示两个 collection
Our extra listing is empty; yours shows two collections.

377
00:22:50,433 --> 00:22:52,743
第 3 步是对话，带一个金色标签
Step 3, the chat, has a gold tag:

378
00:22:52,743 --> 00:22:56,172
每个问题一次 embedding，加一次 Gemini 回答
one embedding and one Gemini answer per question.

379
00:22:56,492 --> 00:22:58,831
暂停一下，选一个 collection，问一个问题
Pause, pick a collection, and ask one.

380
00:22:59,137 --> 00:23:01,356
在你的机器上，它会发起三次调用
On your machine, it makes three calls.

381
00:23:01,676 --> 00:23:06,646
第一个调用：API 去问 Google，拿回 256 个数
Call one: the API asks Google, and 256 numbers come back.

382
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:10,964
第二个调用向数据库要 10 个最近的 chunk
Call two asks the database for the 10 nearest chunks.

383
00:23:11,284 --> 00:23:14,458
一个 origin 由协议、主机和 port 组成
An origin is scheme, host and port,

384
00:23:14,458 --> 00:23:18,900
所以来自 3200 的页面去调 8000，就是跨域
so a page from 3200 calling 8000 crosses origins.

385
00:23:19,150 --> 00:23:23,971
默认情况下，浏览器不让页面看到来自别的 origin 的回复
By default, a browser will not let a page see replies from another origin.

386
00:23:24,291 --> 00:23:27,337
服务器可以放行指定的 origin，这就是 CORS
A server can allow named origins; that is CORS,

387
00:23:27,337 --> 00:23:31,289
它能防止别的网站读取你本地的服务
and it keeps other websites from reading your local services.

388
00:23:31,609 --> 00:23:35,342
所以浏览器先发一个预检请求，带上页面的 origin
So the browser first sends a preflight with the page's origin.

389
00:23:35,662 --> 00:23:40,828
数据库查它的白名单，上面是课程的网站和 localhost:3200
The database checks its guest list, the course's site and localhost:3200,

390
00:23:40,828 --> 00:23:43,022
然后返回一张通行证，或者什么都不给
and returns a pass, or nothing.

391
00:23:43,342 --> 00:23:46,520
你的浏览器就是保安：没有通行证，就没有查询
Your browser is the bouncer: no pass, no query.

392
00:23:48,800 --> 00:23:54,048
第三个调用把问题和 10 个 chunk 发给 API，回答随后返回
Call three sends the question and ten chunks to the API, and the answer returns.

393
00:23:54,368 --> 00:23:57,333
额外用 curl 自己写一个 Origin 请求头
An extra curl writes its own Origin header.

394
00:23:57,653 --> 00:24:02,495
两个预检请求都拿到 200 OK，但只有 3200 拿到了通行证
Both preflights get 200 OK, but only 3200 gets a pass;

395
00:24:02,495 --> 00:24:05,632
对浏览器来说，没有通行证就是拒绝
to a browser, no pass is a refusal.

396
00:24:08,166 --> 00:24:09,766
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

397
00:24:09,830 --> 00:24:13,094
你把前端重新发布到 port 3300
You republish the frontend on port 3300.

398
00:24:13,414 --> 00:24:16,230
三个调用里哪一个会失败，curl 又在不在乎？
Which of the three calls fails, and does curl care?

399
00:24:25,066 --> 00:24:28,437
第一个调用能成功：API 允许任何 origin
Call one works: the API allows any origin.

400
00:24:28,757 --> 00:24:30,911
第二个调用根本出不了浏览器
Call two never leaves the browser.

401
00:24:31,231 --> 00:24:33,813
第三个调用在等它，所以永远不会发出去
Call three waits for it, so it is never sent.

402
00:24:34,133 --> 00:24:35,733
而 curl 对这一切都不理会
And curl ignores it all.

403
00:24:35,989 --> 00:24:42,005
CORS 由浏览器执行，由服务器配置，按页面的 origin 来判断
CORS is enforced by the browser, configured by the server, and keyed on the page's origin.

404
00:24:42,325 --> 00:24:49,985
就连 127.0.0.1:3200 和 localhost:3200 也是不同的 origin
Even 127.0.0.1:3200 is a different origin from localhost:3200,

405
00:24:49,985 --> 00:24:53,568
所以要用 localhost 打开这个应用
so open the app at localhost.

406
00:24:53,816 --> 00:24:58,168
要看的是一个回答和 10 条参考来源，带着书名、作者和距离
Look for an answer and ten references, with book, author and distance.

407
00:24:58,488 --> 00:25:02,049
最后想一点：CORS 决定的是哪个页面能看到回复
Last thought: CORS decides which page may see a reply;

408
00:25:02,049 --> 00:25:04,291
这里没有任何东西决定谁能调用
nothing here decides who may call.

409
00:25:04,611 --> 00:25:07,678
一个没有任何保护、用你的密钥花钱的 AI endpoint
An unprotected AI endpoint, spending your key,

410
00:25:07,678 --> 00:25:09,411
正跑在你的笔记本上
is running on your laptop.

411
00:25:10,950 --> 00:25:16,091
第 4 步是奶酪专家 agent：还是对话的三个调用，只多了一个变化
Step 4 is the cheese expert agent: the chat's three calls, with one twist.

412
00:25:16,411 --> 00:25:21,851
Gemini 先挑一个检索工具：按作者搜索，或者按内容搜索
Gemini first picks a retrieval tool: search by author, or search by content.

413
00:25:22,171 --> 00:25:25,350
API 把搜索文本变成一个 embedding
The API turns the search text into an embedding.

414
00:25:25,670 --> 00:25:28,245
然后你的浏览器查询数据库
Then your browser queries the database,

415
00:25:28,245 --> 00:25:31,217
按作者过滤，前提是 Gemini 选了那个工具
filtered by author if Gemini chose that tool.

416
00:25:31,537 --> 00:25:37,297
API 最多循环五次，Gemini 还可能调用服务器上的趣闻工具
The API loops up to five times, and Gemini may call a fun fact tool on the server.

417
00:25:37,617 --> 00:25:41,090
金色标签：一个 agent 问题要花一次 embedding 调用
A gold tag: one agent question costs one embedding

418
00:25:41,090 --> 00:25:43,590
外加 3 到 7 次生成调用
and three to seven generation calls.

419
00:25:43,910 --> 00:25:46,471
暂停一下，选一个 collection，随便问它点什么
Pause, pick a collection, and ask it something.

420
00:25:46,717 --> 00:25:50,599
要看的是一个回答，结尾有一段高亮的趣闻
Look for an answer ending in a highlighted fun fact paragraph.

421
00:25:50,833 --> 00:25:53,436
第 5 步是微调过的奶酪模型
Step 5 is the fine-tuned cheese model.

422
00:25:53,756 --> 00:25:56,626
README 说要换成你自己的 endpoint
The README says to swap in your own endpoint,

423
00:25:56,626 --> 00:25:59,814
就是你在第 8 讲微调时打印出来的那个
the one your fine-tuning run printed in lecture 8.

424
00:26:00,134 --> 00:26:01,734
暂停一下，贴上你自己的
Pause and paste yours.

425
00:26:01,926 --> 00:26:06,961
服务器会自己重新加载，因为这个文件在 api 目录下面
The server reloads by itself, because this file sits under the api folder.

426
00:26:07,281 --> 00:26:10,680
它旁边的 agent 工具文件没有被监视
Its neighbor, the agent tools file, is not watched;

427
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:14,279
至于那个文件，要按 Ctrl-C，再把服务器重新启动
for that one, press Ctrl-C and start the server again.

428
00:26:14,517 --> 00:26:20,128
然后打开 localhost:3200/finetunechat，问同一个问题
Then open localhost:3200/finetunechat and ask the same question.

429
00:26:20,448 --> 00:26:22,688
第一部分的那个谜题，在这里揭晓答案
Here the part 1 puzzle gets its answer.

430
00:26:23,008 --> 00:26:28,086
用默认值的话，endpoint 路径指向授课老师的项目
With the default, the endpoint path points into the instructor's project,

431
00:26:28,086 --> 00:26:30,242
你的账号在那里没有角色
where your account has no role,

432
00:26:30,242 --> 00:26:32,885
所以预计会是 403，或者“找不到”的错误
so expect a 403, or a not-found error.

433
00:26:33,205 --> 00:26:35,771
这个调用还用了第二个客户端
This call also uses a second client,

434
00:26:35,771 --> 00:26:39,264
位于 us 区域，因为微调过的模型需要它
in the us location, because tuned models need it.

435
00:26:39,584 --> 00:26:42,296
最后一个金色标签：调用微调过的模型
A final gold tag: calls to a tuned model

436
00:26:42,296 --> 00:26:45,685
费用记在拥有这个 endpoint 的项目上
are billed to whichever project owns the endpoint.

437
00:26:46,005 --> 00:26:47,270
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try it;

438
00:26:47,270 --> 00:26:50,246
没有你自己的 endpoint 的话，预计会是 403
without your own endpoint, expect a 403,

439
00:26:50,246 --> 00:26:51,846
或者“找不到”的错误
or a not-found error.

440
00:26:52,128 --> 00:26:55,040
要是你自己的 endpoint 返回 404
If your own endpoint returns 404 instead,

441
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:57,951
请看学习指南里关于基础地址的说明
see the base URL note in the study guide.

442
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:01,496
该关掉了，看看什么能留下来
Time to shut down, and see what survives.

443
00:27:01,816 --> 00:27:06,723
在 API 和前端的终端里，按 Ctrl-C，然后输入 exit
In the API and frontend terminals, press Ctrl-C, then type exit.

444
00:27:07,043 --> 00:27:08,486
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

445
00:27:08,536 --> 00:27:11,127
两个 container 都是用 --rm 跑的
Both containers ran with --rm,

446
00:27:11,127 --> 00:27:15,533
所以额外跑一下 docker ps，只剩下数据库
so an extra docker ps shows only the database left.

447
00:27:15,767 --> 00:27:19,316
现在是 README 的停止命令 docker compose down
Now the README's stop command, docker compose down,

448
00:27:19,316 --> 00:27:20,916
在 llm-rag 里运行
inside llm-rag.

449
00:27:20,994 --> 00:27:22,416
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

450
00:27:22,466 --> 00:27:25,026
数据库和它的网络都被删掉了
The database and its network are removed.

451
00:27:25,346 --> 00:27:27,721
两条警告说变量没有设置
Two warnings say variables are not set,

452
00:27:27,721 --> 00:27:30,462
因为我们是在 shell 脚本之外跑的这条命令
because we ran this outside the shell script,

453
00:27:30,462 --> 00:27:33,324
Compose 就用你 shell 里的值来填这些空
and Compose fills those blanks from your shell.

454
00:27:33,644 --> 00:27:36,994
这就是第一部分讲的那个机制，这次在现实里撞上了
That is the mechanism from part 1, caught in the wild.

455
00:27:37,314 --> 00:27:41,964
来想一个问题：数据库没了，可你的 embedding 也没了吗？
Something to ponder: the database is gone, but are your embeddings gone too?

456
00:27:42,284 --> 00:27:43,884
那什么才会让它们消失？
And what would make them gone?

457
00:27:50,683 --> 00:27:55,543
不会。额外列一下目录，可以看到数据库文件还在磁盘上
No. An extra listing shows the database file still on disk,

458
00:27:55,543 --> 00:28:00,006
在你笔记本上的一个目录里，挂载到 container 里的 /data
in a folder on your laptop, mounted into the container at /data.

459
00:28:00,326 --> 00:28:03,206
一个个 container 来来去去，挂载的目录却留下来
Containers come and go; mounted folders stay.

460
00:28:03,526 --> 00:28:07,750
额外重启一次，数据库就在同一个目录上重新回来了
An extra restart brings the database back over that same folder.

461
00:28:08,070 --> 00:28:12,166
删掉 docker-volumes 目录，才会丢掉你的 embedding
Deleting the docker-volumes folder is what loses your embeddings.

462
00:28:12,486 --> 00:28:14,364
重新加载一次也能干净地重建
A fresh load rebuilds cleanly,

463
00:28:14,364 --> 00:28:18,246
因为加载器会先删掉、再重新创建每个 collection
because the loader deletes and then recreates each collection.

464
00:28:18,483 --> 00:28:22,384
挂载目录的云端版本就是 bucket
The cloud version of a mounted folder is a storage bucket,

465
00:28:22,384 --> 00:28:25,075
一个任何有权限的机器都能看到的目录
a folder any authorized machine can see.

466
00:28:25,395 --> 00:28:27,784
它的目录其实只是名字前缀
Its folders are only name prefixes.

467
00:28:28,104 --> 00:28:32,518
存储客户端没有传入密钥路径，所以 ADC 会找到同一个密钥
The storage client takes no key path, so ADC finds the same key,

468
00:28:32,518 --> 00:28:36,105
再由一个存储角色允许它往 bucket 里写
and a storage role allows it to write to the bucket.

469
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:40,943
这个应用从不调用 bucket，所以 Storage Admin 一直是灰的
This app never calls a bucket, which is why Storage Admin sat gray;

470
00:28:40,943 --> 00:28:42,543
下节课会用到一个
next lecture uses one.

471
00:28:42,771 --> 00:28:44,457
课上给了四条规则
The lecture gives four rules.

472
00:28:44,777 --> 00:28:47,333
只授予对象管理员角色，不要给完整的管理员角色
Grant object admin, not full admin.

473
00:28:47,571 --> 00:28:49,171
让 bucket 保持私有
Keep buckets private.

474
00:28:49,363 --> 00:28:51,539
给它们全球唯一的名字加上前缀
Prefix their globally unique names.

475
00:28:51,859 --> 00:28:56,489
还有，不再需要的就删掉，因为存储和下载都要花钱
And delete what you no longer need, because storage and downloads cost money.

476
00:28:57,533 --> 00:29:01,117
如果你试过重启，就再跑一次：docker compose down
If you tried the restart, run docker compose down once more.

477
00:29:01,437 --> 00:29:04,253
额外跑一条命令，删掉共用的网络
An extra command removes the shared network.

478
00:29:04,573 --> 00:29:06,557
暂停一下，把你的机器收拾干净
Pause, and leave your machine clean.

479
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:09,040
这一讲在云上什么都没启动
This lecture started nothing in the cloud.

480
00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:13,243
留下来的是密钥，而泄露的密钥会花掉你的钱
What stays behind is the key, and a leaked key can spend your money.

481
00:29:13,563 --> 00:29:16,784
不再用的密钥要删掉，连同它们的本地文件
Delete keys you no longer use, and their local files.

482
00:29:17,104 --> 00:29:20,512
如果有密钥被推到了 GitHub，马上在 IAM 里删掉它
If one reaches GitHub, delete it in IAM at once;

483
00:29:20,512 --> 00:29:24,275
上节课那个检测私钥的 hook 会先拦住它
last lecture's private key hook would catch it first,

484
00:29:24,275 --> 00:29:25,978
前提是你把它加进了自己的 repo
once added to your repo.

485
00:29:26,216 --> 00:29:28,157
整节课，放在一张地图上
The whole lecture, on one map.

486
00:29:28,477 --> 00:29:30,123
你代码的工牌和密钥
Your code's badge and key

487
00:29:30,123 --> 00:29:33,085
在 Google 的令牌柜台换来一张一小时有效的票
buy a one-hour ticket at Google's token desk.

488
00:29:33,405 --> 00:29:36,712
一个 IAM 格子让这个工牌能调用 Gemini
One IAM cell lets that badge call Gemini.

489
00:29:37,032 --> 00:29:39,400
一个挂载把密钥送到 /secrets
A mount carries the key to /secrets.

490
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:41,576
各个 container 拨名字
Containers dial names;

491
00:29:41,576 --> 00:29:46,805
你的浏览器拨 localhost，穿过 3200 到 3000 这样的门
your browser dials localhost, through doors like 3200 to 3000,

492
00:29:46,805 --> 00:29:48,744
这些门也对你的 Wi-Fi 敞开
open to your Wi-Fi too.

493
00:29:49,064 --> 00:29:52,478
浏览器经过 CORS 保安，把三个调用串在一起
The browser stitches three calls past the CORS bouncer,

494
00:29:52,478 --> 00:29:55,208
向量则留在一个挂载的目录里
and the vectors survive in a mounted folder.

495
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:58,547
出了问题，先找它在哪一层
When something breaks, find its layer.

496
00:29:58,867 --> 00:30:01,491
凭据错误：路径或者挂载
A credentials error: the path or the mount.

497
00:30:01,811 --> 00:30:04,179
401：没有有效的令牌
A 401: no valid token.

498
00:30:04,499 --> 00:30:07,678
403：角色、项目，或者 API
A 403: role, project, or API.

499
00:30:07,998 --> 00:30:09,918
一行 CORS 报错：origin
A CORS line: the origin.

500
00:30:10,238 --> 00:30:12,009
被占用的 port：门
A taken port: the doors.

501
00:30:12,329 --> 00:30:14,483
脚本挂了：第 14 行
A dying script: line 14.

502
00:30:14,733 --> 00:30:16,738
五道自测题
5 questions to test yourself.

503
00:30:17,058 --> 00:30:21,410
第一题：ADC 找的三个位置；这个教程填的是哪一个？
One: the three places ADC looks; which does this tutorial fill?

504
00:30:21,730 --> 00:30:24,719
第二题：为什么是 /secrets，而不是你的 Mac？第三题
Two: why /secrets, not your Mac? Three:

505
00:30:24,719 --> 00:30:28,834
加载器的名字和你浏览器的 localhost，为什么不能互换？
why can the loader's name and your browser's localhost not swap?

506
00:30:29,154 --> 00:30:30,703
第四题：在 port 3300 上
Four: on port 3300,

507
00:30:30,703 --> 00:30:35,106
哪个调用最先出问题，API 又为什么没事？
which call breaks first, and why does the API survive?

508
00:30:35,426 --> 00:30:39,565
第五题：403 有三种原因；你怎么区分它们？
Five: a 403 has three causes; how do you tell them apart?

509
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:43,491
答案在练习里，命令在学习指南里
Answers are in the exercises, commands in the study guide.

510
00:30:43,811 --> 00:30:46,194
下节课：一个新的服务账号
Next lecture: a new service account,

511
00:30:46,194 --> 00:30:48,973
以及带着自己 CORS 白名单的真正的 bucket
and real buckets with their own CORS list.
